; Regression: a style rule made only of combinators once made the style item loop spin
; without consuming tokens (the parser's fuel assertion caught it). `:::` becomes a
; pseudo-element and a pseudo-class without names, `&&&` a compound of three nesting
; selectors (a descendant of the first compound), `>` a combinator with no selector after
; it, and the rest of the rule is skipped up to the style block's `}`.
(SourceFile
  (ComponentDecl component T
    (MemberList
      (StyleBlock style
        (StyleRule
          (Selector
            (CompoundSelector (PseudoElement) (PseudoClass))
            (CompoundSelector (NestingSelector &) (NestingSelector &) (NestingSelector &))
            >)
          (ErrorNode > > + + + ~ ~ ~))))))
